      "writtenOn": "2023-01-20T19:06:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, I do not have an associated bug component for this change at the moment. But to give you some context regarding this addition, there are ongoing [changes](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/tools/metalava/+/2270406) to enable the generation of Java API stub files using API text files. Based on these changes, Java stub `android.jar` files will be generated using text files-based stub Java files. The `java_api_contribution` modules, which are located in each API domains ([examples](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/q/java_api_contribution)), provide text files needed for `java_api_library` module to generate the `android.jar` files per API surface.",
